"smoke tests on Linux/macOS/Windows plus the `io-network-backend`, `docs-"
"notebook`, and `io-zarr` gates driven by `scripts/ci/run_gate.py`"
msgstr ""
"extended verification workflow（手動実行）が対象とするチェック：Linux/macOS/Windows "
"でのインポートスモークテストに加え、`scripts/ci/run_gate.py` が駆動する `io-network-backend`・`docs-"
"notebook`・`io-zarr` ゲート"

#: ../../explanation/verification_and_quality.md:13
#: 7fe1af3dcbcc4260a9f22685d6c5fa83
msgid "Direct I/O formats"
